@startuml
title SplitSmart Domain Model (Proposed)
class Account
class Group
class Membership
class Expense
class ExpenseShare
class ReviewDecision
class Notification
class Balance
class Payment
class Report
enum ExpenseStatus { PENDING; APPROVED; REJECTED }
enum SplitMethod { EQUAL; PERCENTAGE }
Account "1" -- "0..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Membership
Group "1" -- "0..*" Expense
Expense "1" -- "1" Account : submitter
Expense "1" -- "1" Account : payer
Expense "1" -- "1..*" ExpenseShare
ExpenseShare "*" -- "1" Account : participant
Expense "1" -- "0..*" ReviewDecision
Notification "*" -- "1" Account : recipient
Notification "*" -- "1" Expense
Balance "*" -- "1" Account : debtor
Balance "*" -- "1" Account : creditor
Payment "*" -- "1" Account : payer
Payment "*" -- "1" Account : recipient
Report "*" -- "1" Account : requester
Expense --> ExpenseStatus
Expense --> SplitMethod
note right of Expense
Payer is separate from
ordered participants.
Approved effects occur once.
end note
@enduml
